mode: "100644"
text: "# The recycling system + two worked examples\n\n## Build the vault (the queue of proven winners)\nKeep a simple library so recycling is a 30-minute habit, not a scramble. Track per asset:\n\n| Field | Why |\n|---|---|\n| Asset + pillar | what it is, which content pillar |\n| Original date | so you can space the cycle |\n| Native metric | the proof it's worth recycling (saves / CTR / follows) |\n| Evergreen? | exclude time-bound |\n| Last recycled | enforce ~90–120-day spacing |\n| Variants tried | which hook/format/CTA, and what won |\n\nPull winners from **WoopSocial post analytics** for TikTok, LinkedIn, Facebook, Instagram, Pinterest, YouTube, and Bluesky, and from native dashboards otherwise. Audit by goal.\n\n## Cadence (verify-quarterly)\n| Spacing | ~90–120 days per asset before its next cycle |\n| Mix | sprinkle recycled among native new content — don't read as repetitive |\n| Don't | dump a backlog at once, or repost identically |\n\n## Refresh tactics (pick at least one per cycle)\nNew hook / rewritten first line · new opening visual · flipped format (carousel ↔ Reel ↔ text ↔ quote\ncard) · updated stat or example · seasonal angle · new proof point · different CTA. **Change one major\nvariable per variant** so you learn what moved the metric.\n\n## Recipes\n- **Top-post refresh:** take a proven post → new hook + new opening visual → re-queue 90 days later.\n- **Evergreen → new format:** a high-save carousel → a Reel (route the clip via\n  `captions-and-clipping`) or a text post; the **insight** carries over.\n- **Update-and-republish:** an old \"how the algorithm works / our pricing\" post → update the figures →\n  re-publish as \"2026 update.\"\n- **Seasonal re-run:** a general planning post → \"Q4 Boost Guide\" with current dates.\n\n## Worked example 1 — top-post refresh (blunt indie-founder voice)\n```\nRESURFACE: \"Move 30% of every invoice to a Tax account\" — top saves last quarter, evergreen.\nREFRESH: new hook \"Almost missed €4k in tax. One missing step.\" (old opener retired);\n  new opening visual (two-account screen-record). Variable changed = HOOK.\nUPDATE: confirm the €4k figure + any tax-year reference still current.\nSCHEDULE: ~100 days after original; IG + LinkedIn, native format each.\nEVALUATE: watch saves vs the original; if it wins, re-queue in Q4.\n```\n\n## Worked example 2 — update-and-republish (warm studio voice)\n```\nRESURFACE: \"How the Instagram algorithm ranks you\" — strong reach, but 18 months old (facts drifted).\nREFRESH: reframe as \"What changed in 2026\" + new clean template.\nUPDATE: replace old ranking factors/figures with current ones; verify before publishing.\nSCHEDULE: now (relevance-driven); carousel on IG, text on LinkedIn.\nEVALUATE: track shares + profile visits; one-variable test on the CTA next cycle.\n```\n\nBoth: read brand-profile + voice-builder first; recycle the **insight** refreshed (not identical);\nfacts updated; spaced deliberately; winners chosen from native analytics. The agent drafts; a human\nreviews; publish via `scheduling-and-queue → WoopSocial` (edits = delete + recreate).\n"
